-scoping-management-apis.md\n <code>📝 Documentation</code> <code> +41/-0 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Management API Tenant Scoping Enforcement\n><pre>\n>• Added negative test scenario for tenant scoping in management APIs\n>• Demonstrated cross-tenant access prevention for upstreams\n>• Specified expected <b><i>403 Forbidden</i></b> or <b><i>404 Not Found</i></b> responses\n></pre>\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/hypernetix/hyperspot/pull/322/files#diff-dd532d523eb43eb4de21a70adfb6d74ad16c0e8f481c3c7bfbec823d6557e34b'> modules/system/oagw/scenarios/management-api/auth/negative-1.3-tenant-scoping-management-apis.md\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>27. modules/system/oagw/scenarios/management-api/auth/negative-1.2-permission-gates-upstream-route-plugin-crud.md\n <code>📝 Documentation</code> <code> +44/-0 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Management API Permission Gates\n><pre>\n>• Added negative test scenario for permission-based access control on management APIs\n>• Demonstrated rejection of requests lacking required permissions\n>• Specified expected <b><i>403 Forbidden</i></b> response with problem details\n></pre>\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/hypernetix/hyperspot/pull/322/files#diff-065f0021125dff3bf83629fa715e9e88d231b3c8eb8592c3fd1e72f0dc900dc9'> modules/system/oagw/scenarios/management-api/auth/negative-1.2-permission-gates-upstream-route-plugin-crud.md\n </a>\n<hr/>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>28. modules/system/oagw/scenarios/plugins/guards/positive-10.2-built-cors-handling.md\n <code>📝 Documentation</code> <code> +43/-0 </code>  </summary>  \n\n<br/>\n\n>Built-in CORS Preflight Handling\n><pre>\n>• Added positive example for built-in CORS handling with preflight requests\n>• Demonstrated CORS configuration with allowed origins, methods, headers, and credentials\n>• Specified expected <b><i>204 No Content</i></b> response with CORS headers\n></pre>\n>\n><a href='https://github.com/hypernetix/hyperspot/pull/322/files#dif