 unclear sentence under the \"Inbound Authentication\"\nsection that currently reads \"The authentication is ingoing design state\" with a\nclear, grammatical statement about status—e.g., \"Inbound authentication design\nis in progress\" or \"Inbound authentication will be addressed in a future\niteration\"; locate the \"Inbound Authentication\" heading and update the sentence\nthat contains \"The authentication is ingoing design state\" accordingly to\nreflect the chosen phrasing.\n- Line 97: There is a typo in the call to getTenantConifg; update the invocation\nto the correctly spelled function getTenantConfig (the call that assigns\ntenantConfig using req.tenant, route.id, upstream.id) so the code references\ngetTenantConfig(...) instead of getTenantConifg(...).\n- Line 882: Update the protocol negotiation list to remove the duplicated entry:\nfind the line containing the text \"Protocol Negotiation (HTTP/1.1, HTTP/2,\nHTTP/2, gRPC)\" in DESIGN.md and change it to \"Protocol Negotiation (HTTP/1.1,\nHTTP/2, gRPC)\" so the HTTP/2 entry appears only once.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧹 Nitpick comments (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n<details>\n<summary>modules/system/oagw/DESIGN.md (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`48-49`: **Complete or remove the CORS section.**\n\nThe CORS section header is present but has no content. Either document the CORS handling approach or remove this placeholder to avoid confusion.\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit for review status -->","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/322#pullrequestreview-3710560285","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/322","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/322#pullrequestreview-3710560285"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-ru