  * Added PowerPoint support (.pptx): extracts slide headings, paragraphs, lists, tables, and page breaks; preserves filename and content-type metadata.\n\n* **Tests**\n  * Added unit/integration tests for both parsers and an end-to-end test suite.\n  * Added a utility script to generate XLSX/PPTX test data.\n\n<sub>✏️ Tip: You can customize this high-level summary in your review settings.</sub>\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-01-27T08:00:44Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T11:16:50Z","closed_at":"2026-01-30T11:16:50Z","merged_at":"2026-01-30T11:16:50Z","merge_commit_sha":"c4148f3cc9204757d0fac002db9378e7e223c743","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/319/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/319/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/319/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/statuses/9bd35dcfa89ab9e5b9fbf6b2e161f61eb46294b5","head":{"label":"alizid10:feature/file-parser-xlsx-pptx","ref":"feature/file-parser-xlsx-pptx","sha":"9bd35dcfa89ab9e5b9fbf6b2e161f61eb46294b5","user":{"login":"alizid10","id":247960800,"node_id":"U_kgDODseU4A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/247960800?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10","html_url":"https://github.com/alizid10","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.githu