ic-api/crates/mod.html\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\ncurl -s \"https://crates.io/api/v1/categories\" | jq -r '.categories[].slug' | sort\n```\n\nRepository: hypernetix/hyperspot\n\nLength of output: 204\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\ncurl -s \"https://crates.io/api/v1/categories\" | jq -r '.categories[].slug' | grep -E \"^(directory|development-tools)\"\n```\n\nRepository: hypernetix/hyperspot\n\nLength of output: 46\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\ncurl -s \"https://crates.io/api/v1/categories\" | jq -r '.categories[].slug' | grep \"development\"\n```\n\nRepository: hypernetix/hyperspot\n\nLength of output: 46\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\ncurl -s \"https://crates.io/api/v1/categories\" | jq -r '.categories[].slug' | head -50\n```\n\nRepository: hypernetix/hyperspot\n\nLength of output: 204\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\ncurl -s \"https://crates.io/api/v1/categories\" | jq -r '.categories[].slug' | wc -l\n```\n\nRepository: hypernetix/hyperspot\n\nLength of output: 66\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\ncurl -s \"https://crates.io/api/v1/categories\" | jq -r '.categories[] | \"\\(.slug)\"' | grep -i \"service\\|directory\\|network\\|server\"\n```\n\nRepository: hypernetix/hyperspot\n\nLength of output: 46\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\ncurl -s \"https://crates.io/api/v1/categories\" | jq -r '.categories[].slug'\n```\n\nRepository: hypernetix/hyperspot\n\nLength of output: 204\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**Remove or replace the invalid `categories` entry before publish.**\n\n`directory-service` is not a valid crates.io category. The valid categories are: `accessibility`, `aerospace`, `algorithms`, `asynchronous`, `authentication`, `automotive`, `caching`, `command-line-interface`, `command-line-utilities`, and `api-bindings`. Remove the invalid entry or replace it with a valid category if applicable.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@libs/system-sdks/sdks/directory/Cargo.toml` around lines 9 - 12, The\nCargo.toml contains an invalid crates.io category under the categories =\n[\"directory-service\"] entry; update the categories key by removing\n\"directory-service\" or replacing it with a valid crates.io category (e.g.,\n\"api-bindings\" or another from the allowed list) so the package can be\npublished; locate the categories entry in the Cargo.toml and edit that line\naccordingly.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:eagle -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Confirmed as addressed by @MikeFalcon77\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-01-27T01:40:00Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T08:08:01Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/315#discussion_r2729905808","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/315","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729905808"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/315#discussion_r2729905808"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/315"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729905808/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":9,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":12,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":7,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729905810","pull_request_review_id":3708742689,"id":2729905810,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6itw6S","diff_hunk":"@@ -1,10 +1,15 @@\n [package]\n name = \"cf-simple-user-settings-sdk\"\n version = \"0.1.0\"\n+publish = false\n edition.workspace = true\n license.workspace = true\n authors.workspace = tr