ing vendor\n+    vendor: \"cyberfabric\"  # Selects plugin by matching vendor\n```\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@modules/system/tenant_resolver/README.md` around lines 101 - 113, Update the\nREADME config examples so the vendor identifier matches the project branding:\nlocate occurrences of vendor: \"hyperspot\" in the tenant_resolver README config\nsnippets and replace them with vendor: \"cyberfabric\" (preserve surrounding\nquoting/formatting). Ensure both examples that currently show vendor:\n\"hyperspot\" are changed to vendor: \"cyberfabric\" so the docs are consistent with\nthe \"CyberFabric\" naming used elsewhere.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:eagle -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-01-27T02:05:21Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T08:06:41Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/315#discussion_r2729950444","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/315","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729950444"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/315#discussion_r2729950444"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/315"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729950444/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":101,"original_start_line":101,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":113,"original_line":113,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":51,"position":51,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2730744737","pull_request_review_id":3709675794,"id":2730744737,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6iw9uh","diff_hunk":"@@ -115,21 +98,22 @@ See [`error.rs`](t