 files. No functional logic modifications.\n\n## Changes\n\n| Cohort / File(s) | Summary |\n|---|---|\n| **Root workspace manifest** <br> `Cargo.toml` | Renamed workspace members: `modules/system/types-registry/*` → `modules/system/types_registry/*` and `modules/simple-user-settings/*` → `modules/simple_user_settings/*`; updated types-registry-sdk dependency path |\n| **Application dependencies** <br> `apps/hyperspot-server/Cargo.toml` | Renamed dependencies: `types-registry` → `types_registry` and `simple-user-settings` → `simple_user_settings`; updated paths to reflect directory renaming |\n| **Configuration files** <br> `config/e2e-local.yaml`, `config/quickstart.yaml` | Updated module keys from `simple-user-settings` to `simple_user_settings` and logging path from `types-registry.log` to `types_registry.log` |\n| **Module dependencies** <br> `modules/simple_user_settings/simple_user_settings/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/tenant_resolver/plugins/single_tenant_tr_plugin/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/tenant_resolver/plugins/static_tr_plugin/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/tenant_resolver/tenant_resolver-gw/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/types_registry/types_registry/Cargo.toml` | Updated relative paths for SDK dependencies to reflect directory renaming from kebab-case to snake_case |\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\n🎯 1 (Trivial) | ⏱️ ~3 minutes\n\n## Possibly related PRs\n\n- **hypernetix/hyperspot#303** — Consistent naming convention refactoring across workspace crate paths with matching kebab-case to snake_case transformations.\n\n## Suggested reviewers\n\n- MikeFalcon77\n- Bechma\n\n## Poem\n\n> 🐰 From dashes to underscores, the paths now align,\n> A rabbit's delight in consistency's design,\n> Module names dancing in snake_case so neat,\n> Configuration harmony, the refactor's sweet treat! ✨\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🚥 Pre-merge checks | ✅ 3</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ Passed checks (3 passed)</summary>\n\n|     Check name     | Status   | Explanation                                                                                                                         |\n| :----------------: | :------- | :---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n|  Description Check | ✅ Passed | Check skipped - CodeRabbit’s high-level summary is enabled.                                                                         |\n|     Title check    | ✅ Passed | The title accurately describes the primary change: renaming module paths from kebab-case to snake_case format across the workspace. |\n| Docstring Coverage | ✅ Passed | No functions found in the changed files to evaluate docstring coverage. Skipping docstring coverage check.                          |\n\n</details>\n\n<sub>✏️ Tip: You can configure your own custom pre-merge checks in the settings.</sub>\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_end -->\n\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3799546612/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":347564,"client_id":"Iv1.6aaafe4fe882736b","slug":"coderabbitai","node_id":"A_kwHOB96YWc4ABU2s","owner":{"login":"coderabbitai","id":132028505,"node_id":"O_kgDOB96YWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132028505?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai","html_url":"https://github.com/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai/followers","following_url":"https://ap