ention (types-registry → types_registry, simple-user-settings → simple_user_settings); updated associated path references accordingly. |\n| **Module Cargo Manifests** <br> `modules/simple_user_settings/simple_user_settings/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/types_registry/types_registry/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/tenant_resolver/.../**/Cargo.toml` | Updated local dependency paths to align with renamed module directories, changing path references from dashed to underscored naming (../types-registry-sdk → ../types_registry_sdk). |\n| **Configuration Files** <br> `config/e2e-local.yaml`, `config/quickstart.yaml` | Renamed module configuration keys (simple-user-settings → simple_user_settings) and updated log file paths (types-registry.log → types_registry.log); added new config fields under simple_user_settings (database.file, config.max_field_length). |\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\n🎯 2 (Simple) | ⏱️ ~15 minutes\n\n## Possibly related PRs\n\n- **hypernetix/hyperspot#303** — Directly overlaps with workspace member path renaming from dashes to underscores in Cargo manifests.\n- **hypernetix/hyperspot#223** — Introduces the simple-user-settings module implementation that this PR renames to use underscore conventions.\n\n## Suggested reviewers\n\n- MikeFalcon77\n- Bechma\n- Artifizer\n\n## Poem\n\n> 🐰 *Dashes fade, underscores bloom,*  \n> *Paths renamed throughout each room,*  \n> *types_registry hops with grace,*  \n> *simple_user_settings find their place,*  \n> *Configuration aligned at last—*  \n> *Old naming conventions now are past!* ✨\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🚥 Pre-merge checks | ✅ 3</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ Passed checks (3 passed)</summary>\n\n|     Check name     | Status   | Explanation                                                                                                                                                                                                          |\n| :----------------: | :------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n|  Description Check | ✅ Passed | Check skipped - CodeRabbit’s high-level summary is enabled.                                                                                                                                                          |\n|     Title check    | ✅ Passed | The title accurately describes the main change: renaming module paths from kebab-case (types-registry, simple-user-settings) to snake_case format (types_registry, simple_user_settings) across the entire codebase. |\n| Docstring Coverage | ✅ Passed | No functions found in the changed files to evaluate docstring coverage. Skipping docstring coverage check.                                                                                                           |\n\n</details>\n\n<sub>✏️ Tip: You can configure your own custom pre-merge checks in the settings.</sub>\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_end -->\n\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n\n<!-- internal state start -->\n\n\n<!--  -->\n\n<!-- internal state end -->","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3798761253/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":347564,"client_id":"Iv1.6aaafe4fe882736b","slug":"coderabbitai","node_id":"A_kwHOB96YWc4ABU2s","owner":{"login":"coderabbitai","id":132028505,"node_id":"O_kgDOB96YWQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132028505?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbita