s/MikeFalcon77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Add a step to label release-plz-created PRs with `release-plz`\r\n- Gate the publish job to run only when a merged PR has the `release-plz` label\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Updated release workflow to label and gate release PRs so publishing runs only when manually invoked or after a labeled PR is merged.\n  * Temporarily disabled semver checking by default to ease initial bootstrap publishing.\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated release docs with the new workflow behavior and bootstrap guidance for crates.io rate limits.\n  * Reworked changelog wording and added an Unreleased section for clearer change tracking.\n\n<sub>✏️ Tip: You can customize this high-level summary in your review settings.</sub>\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-01-23T22:34:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T23:45:47Z","closed_at":"2026-01-23T23:45:47Z","merged_at":"2026-01-23T23:45:47Z","merge_commit_sha":"770417ec5fe1c494310caa0a080db6dfac16031d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"Artifizer","id":192502778,"node_id":"U_kgDOC3lb-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192502778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer","html_url":"https://github.com/Artifizer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artifizer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ar