fabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/303","id":3203376364,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPaLyBs6-76Ts","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/303","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/303.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/303.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/303","number":303,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore(release): automate crates.io publishing with release-plz; align publish/versioning & crate naming","user":{"login":"MikeFalcon77","id":3686170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYxNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3686170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77","html_url":"https://github.com/MikeFalcon77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- add `release-plz.toml`, root `CHANGELOG.md`, and GitHub Actions workflow (`release-plz.yml`) with `workflow_dispatch`\r\n- document release flow in `docs/releasing.md`\r\n- enforce publishing scheme: disable publishing for `apps/**` and `examples/**`; enable intended module crates\r\n- rename publishable packages to `cf-*` for crates.io while preserving Rust crate names via `[lib] name`\r\n- split versioning policy: `libs/cf-modkit*` use workspace version; modules/SDKs use independent versions\r\n- add missing `version = ...` for intra-workspace `path` deps to support `cargo publish`\r\n- rename tenant resolver crate ids from `hs_*` to non-prefixed names (`tenant_resolver_*`, `*_tr_plugin`) across manifests and imports\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Added automated release workflow and workspace release configuration; added release-plz workspace settings.\n  * Marked many example/SDK crates as non-publishable and updated workspace dependency coordinates and workspace build profiles.\n* **Documentation**\n  * Added release documentation and a root CHANGELOG with guidance for automated releases and manual fallback steps.\n* **Refactor**\n  * Standardized package names, dependency coordinates, and manifest metadata; added/adjusted library targets and versions across modules and libs.\n* **Tests**\n  * Updated test imports and mocks to use renamed SDK paths.\n\n<sub>✏️ Tip: You can customize this high-level summary in your review settings.</sub>\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-01-23T13:50:16Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T18:37:20Z","closed_at":"2026-01-23T18:37:20Z","merged_at":"2026-01-23T18:37:20Z","merge_commit_sha":"f1376d77ccc08eddcaa79cbf6ce698e14a390ebd","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/303/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/303/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/303/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/statuses/d24898483e891dd23eac658c2e2d21a92634cbac","head":{"label":"