Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry-sdk/Cargo.toml` at line 2, The\npackage name in the Cargo.toml currently uses mixed punctuation\n(`cf-nodes_registry-sdk`); update the package name to use hyphens consistently\n(rename to `cf-nodes-registry-sdk`) in the Cargo.toml package name field so it\nmatches the `cf-*` naming convention used elsewhere (ensure any workspace or\ndependency references to `cf-nodes_registry-sdk` are also updated to the new\n`cf-nodes-registry-sdk`).\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:ocelot -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commit 5da204f","created_at":"2026-01-23T14:00:29Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T17:11:06Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/303#discussion_r2721315159","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/303","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2721315159"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/303#discussion_r2721315159"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/303"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2721315159/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":2,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":3,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2721315170","pull_request_review_id":3697634974,"id":2721315170,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6iM_li","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@\n+[workspace]\n+# Keep the defaults simple and explicit. We rely on Cargo manifests for:\n+# - which crates are publishable (`publish = false` disables)\n+# - per-crate versioning (explicit `version = ...` for modules/sdks, and `version.workspace = true` for ModKit libs)\n+changelog_update = true\n+git_release_enable = true\n+\n+# We keep a single changelog for the repo. release-plz will update it in the release PR.\n+changelog_path = \"CHANGELOG.md\"\n+\n+# Enable semver checks by default (can be overridden per package if needed later).\n+semver_check = true","path":"release-plz.toml","commit_id":"d24898483e891dd23eac658c2e2d21a92634cbac","original_commit_id":"76e998087fa6cfc7abfef3b99ce42d6c55b410f2","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧩 Analysis chain</summary>\n\n🌐 Web query:\n\n`release-plz workspace configuration options changelog_update git_release_enable semver_check`\n\n💡 Result:\n\nIn `release-plz.toml`, these options exist in **`[workspace]`** (defaults for all packages) and can be overridden per **`[[package]]`**. ([release-plz.dev](https://release-plz.dev/docs/config?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **`changelog_update`**: whether Release-plz updates changelog files.\n  - `true` = update changelogs (**default**)\n  - `false` = don’t update changelogs ([release-plz.dev](https://release-plz.dev/docs/config?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **`git_release_enable`**: whether Release-plz creates a “git release” for the created tag.\n  - `true` = create a git release (**default**)\n  - `false` = don’t create a git release ([release-plz.dev](https://release-plz.dev/docs/config?utm_source=openai))\n\n- **`semver_check`**: whether Release-plz runs `cargo-semver-checks` to detect API-breaking changes (only works for library crates).\n  - `true` = run semver checks (**default**)\n  - `false` = skip semver checks ([release-plz.dev](https://release-plz.dev/docs/config?utm_source=openai))\n\nExample:\n\n```toml\n[workspace]\nchangelog_update = true\ngit_release_enable = true\nsemver_check = false\n\n[[package]]\nname = \"my_crate\"\nsemver_check = true\nchangelog_update = false\n```\n\nCitations:\n\n- 1: https://release-plz.dev/docs/config?utm_source=openai\n- 2: https://release-plz.dev/docs/config?utm_source=openai\n- 3: https://release-plz.dev/docs/config?utm_source=openai\n- 4: https://release-plz.dev/docs/config?utm_source=openai\n\n---\n\n🌐 Web query:\n\n`release-plz changelog_path configuration option`\n\n💡 Result:\n\n`release-plz` lets you change the changelog file location with **`changelog_path`**, but **only in a `[[package]]` section** (it **cannot** be set in `[workspace]`). The path is **relative to the repository root / root `Cargo.toml`** (including in GitHub Actions). [1]\n\nExample:\n\n```toml\n[[package]]\nname = \"my_package\"\nchangelog_path = \"docs/CHANGELOG.md\"\n```\n\nBy default, it uses `CHANGELOG.md` next to the package’s `Cargo.toml`. [1]\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**Remove `changelog_path` from the `[workspace]` section—it can only be set per `[[package]]`.**\n\nThe `changelog_path` option is not supported at the workspace level in release-plz. Move it to individual `[[package]]` sections if different packages need custom changelog locations. For a single changelog at the repository root, rely on the default behavior or configure it per package.\n\nThe other settings (`changelog_update`, `git_release_enable`, and `semver_check`) are correctly configured at the workspace level.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@release-plz.toml` around lines 1 - 12, The workspace-level changelog_path\nsetting is invalid; remove the changelog_path = \"CHANGELOG.md\" entry from the\n[workspace] section and, if a package-specific changelog is required, add\nchangelog_path under the corresponding [[package]] blocks instead (or rely on\nrelease-plz's default repo-root behavior); keep changelog_update,\ngit_release_enable, and semver_check in [workspace] as-is and ensure no other\nworkspace keys reference changelog_path.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:ocelot -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-01-23T14:00:29Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T16:39:05Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/303#discussion_r2721315170","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/303","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2721315170"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/303#discussion_r2721315170"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/303"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2721315170/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":1,"original_start_line":1,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":12,"original_line":12,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","ori