"modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry-sdk/Cargo.toml","commit_id":"7ed8e12ee7d348d122e710eb0a701d0b2642ec5f","original_commit_id":"76e998087fa6cfc7abfef3b99ce42d6c55b410f2","user":{"login":"MikeFalcon77","id":3686170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYxNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3686170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77","html_url":"https://github.com/MikeFalcon77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> _⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟡 Minor_\r\n> \r\n> **Inconsistent package naming convention.**\r\n> \r\n> The package name `cf-nodes_registry-sdk` mixes underscores and hyphens, whereas `cf-types-registry-sdk` uses hyphens consistently. This inconsistency could cause confusion when referencing packages.\r\n> \r\n> Consider standardizing to `cf-nodes-registry-sdk` for consistency with other `cf-*` packages in the workspace.\r\n> \r\n> Suggested fix\r\n> ```diff\r\n>  [package]\r\n> -name = \"cf-nodes_registry-sdk\"\r\n> +name = \"cf-nodes-registry-sdk\"\r\n> ```\r\n> \r\n> 📝 Committable suggestion\r\n> > ‼️ **IMPORTANT**\r\n> > Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.\r\n> \r\n> 🤖 Prompt for AI Agents\r\n\r\n\r\nWe want to publish all pacakges with cf-* prefix for visibility and preventing potential conflicts with other packages. But we don't want have this prefix in code.","created_at":"2026-01-23T15:09:13Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T15:09:13Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/303#discussion_r2721607294","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/303","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2721607294"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/303#discussion_r2721607294"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/303"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2721607294/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":2,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2721315159,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":3,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2721827317","pull_request_review_id":3698284506,"id":2721827317,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6iO8n1","diff_hunk":"@@ -24,7 +25,7 @@ calculator-sdk = { path = \"../calculator-sdk\" }\n modkit = { workspace = true, features = [\"bootstrap\"] }\n modkit-security = { workspace = true }\n modkit-transport-grpc = { workspace = true }\n-grpc_hub = { path = \"../../../../modules/system/grpc_hub\" }\n+grpc_hub = { package = \"cf-grpc_hub\", path = \"../../../../modules/system/grpc_hub\" }","path":"examples/oop-modules/calculator/calculator/Cargo.toml","commit_id":"76e998087fa6cfc7abfef3b99ce42d6c55b410f2","original_commit_id":"76e998087fa6cfc7abfef3b99ce42d6c55b410f2","user":{"login":"Mik