e=30 and if it\nfails immediately exit with that status or set -e so the recipe fails on first\ncrash), ensuring the make target fails when any fuzz target crashes and surfaces\nthe error.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>♻️ Duplicate comments (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Makefile (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`388-388`: **Including `fuzz` in `all` target adds ~4 minutes to standard workflows.**\n\nThis concern was already raised in a past review. Consider removing `fuzz` from the `all` target since fuzzing is resource-intensive and better run explicitly or via CI.\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit for review status -->","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/301#pullrequestreview-3698632307","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/301","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/301#pullrequestreview-3698632307"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/301"}},"submitted_at":"2026-01-23T17:05:21Z","commit_id":"cee3e428503fbbe141f4486655e121cfff0ebb53"},{"id":3705521616,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOPaLyBs7c3cXQ","user":{"login":"Bechma","id":19294519,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5Mjk0NTE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19294519?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma","html_url":"https://github.com/Bechma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bechma/orgs","repos_url":"https://a