ng log text when no signal is sent.**  \n> Line 103 logs “sent termination signal” even when `sent == false`, which can mislead (especially when PID is `None`). Consider neutral wording or conditional logging.  \n> \n> <details>\n> <summary>🛠️ Suggested tweak</summary>\n> \n> ```diff\n> -        \"{context}: sent termination signal\"\n> +        \"{context}: termination signal attempted\"\n> ```\n> </details>\n> \n> </blockquote></details>\n> \n> </blockquote></details>\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit for review status -->","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/300#pullrequestreview-3696984580","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/300","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/300#pullrequestreview-3696984580"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/300"}},"submitted_at":"2026-01-23T11:06:02Z","commit_id":"5df7b91b4376cbc964b6eafa0f823e76808dc462"}]},{"source_pr_number":295,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/295","source_state":"closed","source_author":"MikeFalcon77","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #295] chore(file_parser): switch to docx-rust from crates.io (instead of custom package)","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"chore/update_docx-rust","pr_head_sha":"603838136aeec3c25c57d916e894f05e8169d34f","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"MikeFalcon77","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/295","id":3199654599,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPaLyBs6-ttrH","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/295","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/295.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/295.patch","issue_url":"https://ap