_🔴 Critical_\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧩 Analysis chain</summary>\n\n🌐 Web query:\n\n`docx-rust crates.io 0.1.11 release notes changelog`\n\n💡 Result:\n\nI couldn't find a public changelog or release notes specifically for docx-rust 0.1.11. The crate documentation for v0.1.11 (docs.rs) and package listings are available here for reference: [1], [2]. If you want, I can (a) check the crate's source repo for tags/commits/releases (provide a GitHub/Git host URL if you have one) or (b) fetch the cargo registry entry / commit that corresponds to v0.1.11 and list the diff — which would require me to browse the repository. \n\nSources:\n- docx-rust v0.1.11 docs (docs.rs). [1]\n- docx-rust crate listing / release history (lib.rs / package pages). [2]\n\n---\n\n🌐 Web query:\n\n`docx-rust 0.1.11 PR 54 github`\n\n💡 Result:\n\nDo you want the GitHub PR `#54` for the docx-rust (docx-rs) repository (link/status/summary), or something else about version 0.1.11?\n\n---\n\n🌐 Web query:\n\n`docx-rust latest version crates.io`\n\n💡 Result:\n\nLatest docx-rust on crates.io: 0.1.10 (published May 26, 2025). [1][2]\n\nSources:\n[1] docs.rs — docx-rust 0.1.10.  \n[2] lib.rs — docx-rust releases (0.1.10 dated May 26, 2025).\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**Use docx-rust 0.1.10 instead of 0.1.11—0.1.10 is the latest available version on crates.io.**\n\nThe pinned version 0.1.11 does not appear to exist on crates.io; the latest published release is 0.1.10 (May 26, 2025). Verify which version is intended and update the dependency accordingly to ensure it resolves during build.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@Cargo.toml` at line 356, The Cargo.toml dependency for docx-rust is pinned to\na non-existent \"0.1.11\"; update the docx-rust entry in Cargo.toml from \"0.1.11\"\nto the published \"0.1.10\" and then run cargo update or cargo build to verify the\ndependency resolves; ensure the change targets the docx-rust = \"0.1.11\" line so\nCI and local builds use docx-rust = \"0.1.10\".\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:eagle -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-01-22T14:47:34Z","updated_at":"2026-01-22T16:53:00Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/295#discussion_r2717224735","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/295","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2717224735"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/295#discussion_r2717224735"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/295"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2717224735/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":356,"original_line":356,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2717762245","pull_request_review_id":3693506275,"id":2717762245,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6h_cLF","diff_hunk":"@@ -353,6 +353,7 @@ mime = \"0.3\"\n # Document parsing libraries\n tl = \"0.7\"\n pdf-extract = \"0.10\"\n+docx-rust = \"0.1.11\"","path":"Cargo.toml","commit_id":"603838136aeec3c25c57d916e894f05e8169d34f","original_commit_id":"b645a7461b430e2d2beea9203460ca6b6b7080da","user":{"login":"MikeFalcon77","id":3686170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYxNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3686170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77","html_url":"https://github.com/MikeFalcon77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.