1.11 — docs.rs. ([docs.rs](https://docs.rs/crate/docx-rust/0.1.11?utm_source=openai))  \n[2] docx-rust — lib.rs (releases/version history). ([lib.rs](https://lib.rs/crates/docx-rust?utm_source=openai))\n\nIf you want the GitHub repo for a specific owner (e.g., cstkingkey), tell me and I’ll search for that exact repository and its release/tag.\n\nCitations:\n\n- 1: https://docs.rs/crate/docx-rust/0.1.11?utm_source=openai\n- 2: https://lib.rs/crates/docx-rust?utm_source=openai\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n```\n#!/bin/bash\n# Check if docx-rust 0.1.11 exists on crates.io via API\ncurl -s \"https://crates.io/api/v1/crates/docx-rust/0.1.11\" | jq -r '.version.num, .version.created_at'\n```\n\nLength of output: 34\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n`@MikeFalcon77`, you're absolutely right! I've confirmed that docx-rust 0.1.11 was indeed published to crates.io today (January 22, 2026 at 10:23:03 UTC). My apologies for the incorrect review comment—the version is valid and the dependency specification is correct.\n\nThe search results I initially received were likely cached and hadn't yet reflected the new release. The change to use 0.1.11 from crates.io looks good! 👍\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧠 Learnings used</summary>\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: dylint_lints/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:31.912Z\nLearning: Applies to dylint_lints/**/Cargo.toml : In `Cargo.toml` for lint crates, reference common workspace dependencies (`clippy_utils`, `dylint_linting`, `lint_utils`) using `.workspace = true` to avoid duplication\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: dylint_lints/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-14T17:18:31.912Z\nLearning: Applies to dylint_lints/**/Cargo.toml : Register new lint crates by adding them to the `members` list in the workspace root `Cargo.toml`\n```\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-01-22T16:55:04Z","updated_at":"2026-01-22T16:55:04Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/295#discussion_r2717770132","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/295","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2717770132"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/295#discussion_r2717770132"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/295"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2717770132/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":356,"original_line":356,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2717224735,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"}],"source_reviews":[{"id":3692847101,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOPaLyBs7cHF_9","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**Actionable comments posted: 1**\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Fix all issues with AI agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@Cargo.toml`:\n- Line 356: The Cargo.toml dependency for docx-rust is pinned to a non-existent\n\"0.1.11\"; update the docx-rust entry in Cargo.toml from \"0.1.11\" to the\npublished \"0.1.10\" and then run cargo update or cargo build to verify the\ndependency resolves; ensure the change targets the docx-rust = \"0.1.11\" line so\nCI and local builds use docx-rust = \"0.1.10\".\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit for review status -->","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/295#pullrequestreview-3692847101","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/295","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/295#pullrequestreview-3692847101"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/295"}},"submitted_at":"2026-01-22T14:47:35Z","commit_id":"b645a7461b430e2d2beea9203460ca6b6b7080da"}]},{"source_pr_number":293,"source_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/293","source_state":"closed","source_author":"alizid10","target_issue_number":null,"title":"[PR #293] add debug logging for GTS registration and validation","status":"exported","mirrored_at":null,"comments_status":"none","comments_mirrored":0,"pr_head_ref":"refactor/type_registry_logging_registration","pr_head_sha":"cfd76fb9303e2de3d140c010b92ca451e2dc982d","pr_base_ref":"main","pr_head_owner":"alizid10","pr_from_fork":1,"source_data":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/293","id":3198559012,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPaLyBs6-piMk","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/293","diff_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/293.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/293.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/293","number":293,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"add debug logging for GTS registration and validation","user":{"login":"alizid10","id":247960800,"node_id":"U_kgDODseU4A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/247960800?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10","html_url":"https://github.com/alizid10","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Implements comprehensive debug diagnostics for schema registration:\r\n- Add debug_diagnostics module with schema chain analysis\r\n- Add debug logging in in_memory_repo for validation failures\r\n- Include detailed schema hierarchy and error context\r\n- Add cycle detection for circular schema references\r\n- Include E2E tests for debug logging scenarios\r\n- Update OpenSpec documentation with archived change proposal\r\n\r\n#261 \n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added debug-level diagnostic logging for registration and validation failures, including full entity and schema dumps and schema-chain tracing with cycle detection.\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Added specs and proposal documenting diagnostic logging behavior and requirements.\n\n* **Tests**\n  * Added E2E tests covering debug logging for invalid schemas, instance mismatches, schema chains, and circular references.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Enabled module-level debug logging in local E2E config and CI runner.\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Minor logging/formatting adjustments and indentation fixes.\n\n<sub>✏️ Tip: You can customize this high-level summary in your review settings.</sub>\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2026-01-22T09:20:28Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T11:40:16Z","closed_at":"2026-01-23T11:40:15Z","merged_at":"2026-01-23T11:40:15Z","merge_commit_sha":"0306e9b1afa5fd766106ca6e814e20c9c3757e91","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/293/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/293/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/293/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/statuses/cfd76fb9303e2de3d140c010b92ca451e2dc982d","head":{"label":"alizid10:refactor/type_registry_logging_registration","ref":"refactor/type_registry_logging_registration","sha":"cfd76fb9303e2de3d140c010b92ca451e2dc982d","user":{"login":"alizid10","id":247960800,"node_id":"U_kgDODseU4A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/247960800?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10","html_url":"https://github.com/alizid10","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alizid10/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"