01-30T21:47:30Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T21:47:30Z","body":"Essentially:\r\n\r\nIn the **PRD**, we can move:\r\n1. The requirement to have a unified portal with error documentation\r\n2. The requirement that documentation must clearly allow developers to find the exact place in the code where a given REST API error is defined\r\n\r\nIn the ADR, we should move:\r\n1. Descriptions of how other companies do it and why we use RFC\r\n2. Explanations of why we use GTS\r\n\r\nIn the GUIDELINE, we should keep:\r\n1. References to PRD and ADR\r\n2. How errors must be described in a special / standardized way\r\n3. The requirement that all errors must be registered in the types registry","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3825924145/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3827852303","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/290#issuecomment-3827852303","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/290","id":3827852303,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPaLyBs7kKGQP","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organi