ravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T09:38:55Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T14:11:52Z","body":"<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>📝 Walkthrough</summary>\n\n## Walkthrough\n\nThe pull request introduces a new `local-calculator` module that automatically registers a `CalculatorGrpcClient` in the `ClientHub` via lazy initialization. This replaces the manual wiring pattern previously exposed by `wire_client`. The calculator SDK's public API is refactored to export `CalculatorGrpcClient` and service types instead of wiring utilities. Documentation and module dependencies are updated to reflect the automatic registration approach.\n\n## Changes\n\n| Cohort / File(s) | Summary |\n|---|---|\n| **Cargo Manifest Configuration** <br> `apps/hyperspot-server/Cargo.toml`, `examples/oop-modules/calculator/local-calculator/Cargo.toml` | Added optional `local-calculator` dependency and extended `oop-example` feature to include it; new manifest for local-calculator crate with ModKit and calculator-sdk dependencies. |\n| **Calculator SDK Public API Refactoring** <br> `examples/oop-modules/calculator/calculator-sdk/src/client.rs`, `examples/oop-modules/calculator/calculator-sdk/src/lib.rs` | Changed `CalculatorGrpcClient` visibility from `pub(crate)` to `pub`; removed `wiring` module export and `wire_client` function; added public `proto` module with service types and `SERVICE_NAME` constant. |\n| **Removed Wiring Function** <br> `examples/oop-modules/calculator/calculator-sdk/src/wiring.rs` | File deleted; previously provided manual `wire_client` async function for registering client in `ClientHub`. |\n| **Local Calculator Module (New)** <br> `examples/oop-modules/calculator/local-calculator/src/client.rs`, `examples/oop-modules/calculator/local-calculator/src/lib.rs`, `examples/oop-modules/calculator/local-calculator/src/module.rs` | New module implementing `LocalCalculatorClient` with lazy initialization and `RwLock` caching; `LocalCalculatorModule` struct registers the client via `modkit::Module::init` trait; automatic service discovery via `DirectoryClient`. |\n| **Module Registration & Dependencies** <br> `apps/hyperspot-server/src/registered_modules.rs`, `examples/oop-modules/calculator_gateway/calculator_gateway/src/module.rs` | Updated import alias from `calculator` to `local_calculator` in feature-gated block; removed `deps = [\"calculator\"]` declaration from calculator_gateway module attribute. |\n| **Documentation Updates** <br> `docs/MODKIT_UNIFIED_SYSTEM.md`, `examples/oop-modules/calculator/calculator/src/lib.rs` | Documented two wiring patterns (manual vs. automatic); updated calculator description to reference automatic registration via local-calculator module instead of manual `wire_client`; removed emphasis on wire-time wiring. |\n\n## Sequence Diagram\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant ClientHub\n    participant LocalCalculatorModule\n    participant LocalCalculatorClient\n    participant DirectoryClient\n    participant CalculatorService as CalculatorGRPC<br/>Service\n\n    Note over ClientHub,CalculatorService: Old Pattern (Manual Wiring)\n    \n    ClientHub->>ClientHub: wire_client(hub, resolver)\n    ClientHub->>DirectoryClient: resolve_grpc_service(\"calculator...\")\n    DirectoryClient-->>ClientHub: endpoint\n    ClientHub->>CalculatorService: connect\n    CalculatorService-->>ClientHub: CalculatorGrpcClient\n    ClientHub->>ClientHub: register(Arc<CalculatorGrpcClient>)\n\n    Note over ClientHub,CalculatorService: New Pattern (Automatic Registration)\n    \n    ClientHub->>LocalCalculatorModule: Module::init(ctx)\n    LocalCalculatorModule->>LocalCalculatorModule: create LocalCalculatorClient\n    LocalCalculatorModule->>ClientHub: register(Arc<LocalCalculatorClient>)\n    \n    Note over LocalCalculatorClient,CalculatorService: Lazy Initialization (on first use)\n    \n    LocalCalculatorClient->>LocalCalculatorClient: get_client() - check RwLock\n    LocalCalculatorClient->>DirectoryClient: resolve_grpc_service(\"calculator...\")\n    DirectoryClient-->>LocalCalculatorClient: endpoint\n    LocalCalculatorClient->>CalculatorService: connect\n    CalculatorService-->>LocalCalculatorClient: CalculatorGrpcClient\n    LocalCalculatorClient->>LocalCalculatorClient: cache in RwLock\n```\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\n🎯 3 (Moderate) | ⏱️ ~25 minutes\n\n## Possibly related PRs\n\n- **hypernetix/hyperspot#241**: Modifies the calculator SDK's client/API surface including changes to `CalculatorGrpcClient` visibility and public exports in `calculator-sdk/src/client.rs`.\n\n## Suggested reviewers\n\n- Bechma\n- Artifizer\n- MikeFalcon77\n\n## Poem\n\n> 🐰 *Hop, hop! The wiring's gone,*  \n> *Now lazy clients dance along,*  \n> *With RwLock and service discovery glow,*  \n> *The local-calculator steals the show!*  \n> *No manual dance, just auto-magic—*  \n> *Module init makes it less tragic!* ✨\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🚥 Pre-merge checks | ✅ 3</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ Passed checks (3 passed)</summary>\n\n|     Check name     | Status   | Explanation                                                                                                                                                                                                                |\n| :----------------: | :------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n|     Title check    | ✅ Passed | The title 'fix OoP modules example' accurately reflects the main change: the PR addresses a failing oop-modules example by introducing a new LocalCalculatorClient module that replaces the previous wire_client approach. |\n| Docstring Coverage | ✅ Passed | Docstring coverage is 83.33% which is sufficient. The required threshold is 80.00%.                                                                                                                                        |\n|  Description Check | ✅ Passed | Check skipped - CodeRabbit’s high-level summary is enabled.                                                                                                                                                                |\n\n</details>\n\n<sub>✏️ Tip: You can configure your own custom pre-merge checks in the settings.</sub>\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_end -->\n\n<!-- finishing_touch_checkbox_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>✨ Finishing touches</summary>\n\n- [ ] <!-- {\"checkboxId\": \"7962f53c-55bc-4827-bfbf-6a18da830691\"} --> 📝 Generate docstrings\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- finishing_touch_checkbox_end -->\n\n<!-- tips_start -->\n\n---\n\n\n\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands and usage tips.</sub>\n\n<!-- tips_end -->\n\n<!-- internal state start -->