l request \r\n\r\n**Chat about your code** : Chat with the bot around your code. The more you chat, the smarter it gets.\r\n\r\n**Issue Validation**:  Validates the PR against the linked issues and identifies other related issues \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","external_url":"https://coderabbit.ai?utm_source=cr_app&utm_medium=github","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","created_at":"2023-06-14T15:47:27Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T07:58:44Z","permissions":{"actions":"read","checks":"write","contents":"write","discussions":"read","issues":"write","members":"read","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"write"},"events":["issues","issue_comment","label","organization","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","release","repository"]}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3799947916","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/289#issuecomment-3799947916","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/289","id":3799947916,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPaLyBs7ifpqM","user":{"login":"MikeFalcon77","id":3686170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYxNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3686170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77","html_url":"https://github.com/MikeFalcon77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MikeFalcon77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-26T14:41:39Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T14:41:39Z","body":"ghost modules for remote OoP modules looks not consistenet design solution.\r\n\r\nI've created two issues with ADRs which will close a problems like this:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/hypernetix/hyperspot/issues/298\r\nhttps://github.com/hypernetix/hyperspot/issues/297","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3799947916/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null}],"source_review_comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2711780511","pull_request_review_id":3686279707,"id":2711780511,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6honyf","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@\n+[package]\n+name = \"local-calculator\"\n+version = \"0.1.0\"\n+edition.workspace = true\n+license.workspace = true\n+authors.workspace = true\n+description = \"Local CalculatorClient module that lazily initializes gRPC client using DirectoryClient\"\n+\n+[dependencies]\n+# Calculator SDK for API trait and types\n+calculator-sdk = { path = \"../calculator-sdk\" }\n+\n+# ModKit dependencies\n+modkit = { path = \"../../../../libs/modkit\" }\n+modkit-security = { path = \"../../../../libs/modkit-security\" }\n+modkit-transport-grpc = { path = \"../../../../libs/modkit-transport-grpc\" }\n+module_orchestrator-sdk = { path = \"../../../../modules/system/module_orchestrator/module_orchestrator-sdk\" }\n+\n+# gRPC dependencies\n+tonic = { workspace = true, features = [\"transport\"] }\n+async-trait = { workspace = true }\n+\n+# Error handling and utilities\n+anyhow = { workspace = true }\n+tracing = { workspace = true }\n+tokio = { workspace = true, features = [\"sync\"] }\n+inventory = { workspace = true }","path":"examples/oop-modules/calculator/local-calculator/Cargo.toml","commit_id":"5e6af8db4af53140a2217ab9e9aea34cb57f866e","original_commit_id":"5e6af8db4af53140a2217ab9e9aea34cb57f866e","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🔴 Critical_\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧩 Analysis chain</summary>\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\n#!/bin/bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\nroot=$(rg -l -g 'Cargo.toml' '^\\[workspace\\]' | head -n 1)\nif [[ -z \"${root}\" ]]; then\n  echo \"No workspace Cargo.toml found.\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n\npython - <<PY\nimport tomllib, pathlib\nroot = pathlib.Path(\"$root\")\ndata = tomllib.loads(root.read_text())\nmembers = data.get(\"workspace\", {}).get(\"members\", [])\nprint(\"workspace file:\", root)\nprint(\"has local-calculator:\",\n      any(\"examples/oop-modules/calculator/local-calculator\" in m for m in members))\nPY\n```\n\nRepository: hypernetix/hyperspot\n\nLength of output: 150\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\n#!/bin/bash\ncat Cargo.toml | head -100\n```\n\nRepository: hypernetix/hyperspot\n\nLength of output: 3359\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**Add crate to workspace members list.**\n\nThe `local-calculator` crate uses `edition.workspace`, `license.workspace`, and `authors.workspace`, but it is not registered in the root `Cargo.toml` members list. Add `\"examples/oop-modules/calculator/local-calculator\"` to the workspace members to resolve the Cargo configuration error.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@examples/oop-modules/calculator/local-calculator/Cargo.toml` around lines 1 -\n27, The workspace error occurs because the local-calculator crate is using\nworkspace-wide fields but is not listed in the root Cargo.toml members; open the\nroot Cargo.toml and add the local-calculator crate’s directory to the workspace\nmembers array so the \"local-calculator\" package is included in the workspace\nbuild (ensure the members entry matches the crate's relative directory name and\ncommit the change).\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:medusa:eagle -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-01-21T09:49:16Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T09:49:17Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/289#discussion_r2711780511","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/289","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2711780511"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/289#discussion_r2711780511"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/289"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2711780511/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":1,"original_start_line":1,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":27