user_settings/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-26T20:17:34.527Z\nLearning: Use `@/openspec/AGENTS.md` to learn how to create and apply change proposals, spec format and conventions, and project structure and guidelines\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/simple_user_settings/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-26T20:17:56.723Z\nLearning: Create proposal when adding features or functionality, making breaking changes (API, schema), changing architecture or patterns, optimizing performance (changes behavior), or updating security patterns\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types_registry/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-26T20:18:00.667Z\nLearning: Always open `@/openspec/AGENTS.md` when the request mentions planning or proposals (words like proposal, spec, change, plan), introduces new capabilities, breaking changes, architecture shifts, or big performance/security work, or sounds ambiguous and you need the authoritative spec before coding\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/simple_user_settings/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-26T20:17:56.723Z\nLearning: Always run 'openspec validate [change] --strict' before requesting approval to resolve any validation issues\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types_registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-26T20:18:20.806Z\nLearning: Create `proposal.md`, `tasks.md`, `design.md` (only if needed), and delta specs per affected capability in `changes/<change-id>/` directory\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-22T13:25:08.131Z\nLearning: Always follow the guidelines specified in `@/guidelines/README.md`\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types_registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-26T20:18:20.806Z\nLearning: Consult project conventions and best practices in `guidelines/` directory\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/system/types_registry/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-26T20:18:20.806Z\nLearning: Create `design.md` only if the change involves cross-cutting changes (multiple services/modules), new architectural patterns, external dependencies, significant data model changes, security/performance complexity, or migration complexity\n```\n\n---\n\n```\nLearnt from: CR\nRepo: hypernetix/hyperspot PR: 0\nFile: modules/simple_user_settings/openspec/AGENTS.md:0-0\nTimestamp: 2026-01-26T20:17:56.723Z\nLearning: Create design.md only if the change involves cross-cutting changes (multiple services/modules), new architectural patterns, new external dependencies, significant data model changes, security/performance/migration complexity, or ambiguity requiring technical decisions\n```\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated reply by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-01-26T20:32:22Z","updated_at":"2026-01-26T20:32:22Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/287#discussion_r2729151229","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/287","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729151229"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/287#discussion_r2729151229"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/287"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2729151229/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":287,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":293,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2726968966,"author_association":"CONTRIBUT