/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_\n\n**Path-only dependency will also block `cargo publish`.**\n\nSame issue as `module_orchestrator-sdk`: `module_orchestrator-grpc` is path-only, which will cause `cargo publish` to fail. Since this crate is intended for crates.io publishing (no `publish = false`), this dependency also needs a version specifier.\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>🔧 Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-module_orchestrator-grpc = { path = \"../../modules/system/module_orchestrator/module_orchestrator-grpc\", optional = true }\n+module_orchestrator-grpc = { workspace = true, optional = true }\n```\n\nAlternatively, if these orchestrator crates aren't ready for workspace resolution:\n```diff\n-module_orchestrator-grpc = { path = \"../../modules/system/module_orchestrator/module_orchestrator-grpc\", optional = true }\n+module_orchestrator-grpc = { version = \"0.1.0\", path = \"../../modules/system/module_orchestrator/module_orchestrator-grpc\", optional = true }\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@libs/modkit/Cargo.toml` at line 52, The dependency declaration for\nmodule_orchestrator-grpc in Cargo.toml is path-only which will prevent cargo\npublish; change the entry to use a versioned dependency (e.g.\nmodule_orchestrator-grpc = { version = \"x.y.z\", optional = true } ) or, if the\ncrate should not be published yet, set the crate's own Cargo.toml to publish =\nfalse; update the module_orchestrator-grpc line accordingly rather than leaving\nit as a path-only dependency.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:ocelot -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->\n\n✅ Addressed in commit 9e59909","created_at":"2026-01-21T13:57:21Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T15:27:48Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/284#discussion_r2712693051","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/284","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2712693051"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/284#discussion_r2712693051"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/284"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2712693051/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":52,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":64,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2713112365","pull_request_review_id":3687885583,"id":2713112365,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6hts8t","diff_hunk":"@@ -1,15 +1,19 @@\n [package]\n-name = \"module_orchestrator-grpc\"\n+name = \"cf-system-directory-grpc\"\n version = \"0.1.0\"\n edition.workspace = true\n license.workspace = true\n authors.workspace = true\n-description = \"gRPC transport layer for module orchestrator\"\n+description = \"gRPC transport layer for directory service\"\n build = \"build.rs\"\n+include = [\"proto\"]\n+\n+[lib]\n+name = \"cf_system_directory_grpc\"","path":"libs/system-sdks/directory-grpc/Cargo.toml","commit_id":"9e5990928b7e0e8d6f271c7c806bbdce68e2d056","original_commit_id":"9e5990928b7e0e8d6f271c7c806bbdce68e2d056","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/coderabbitai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧩 Analysis chain</summary>\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\n#!/bin/bash\n# First, check the actual Cargo.toml content\necho \"=== Cargo.toml content ===\"\ncat libs/system-sdks/directory-grpc/Cargo.toml\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Files in directory-grpc directory ===\"\nfind libs/system-sdks/directory-grpc -type f | head -20\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Check if src directory exists ===\"\nls -la libs/system-sdks/directory-grpc/src 2>&1 || echo \"src directory not found or error\"\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Check if build.rs exists ===\"\nls -la libs/system-sdks/directory-grpc/build.rs 2>&1 || echo \"build.rs not found\"\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Check proto directory ===\"\nls -la libs/system-sdks/directory-grpc/proto 2>&1 || echo \"proto directory not found\"\n```\n\nRepository: hypernetix/hyperspot\n\nLength of output: 1735\n\n---\n\n🌐 Web query:\n\n`Cargo.toml include field behavior exclusive src directory`\n\n💡 Result:\n\nShort answer: specifying package.include makes the package list exclusive — Cargo will include only the files that match the include patterns (plus a few always-included items). So if you use package.include you must explicitly include src (e.g. \"src/**\" or \"/src\") or your source files will be omitted. The include list also overrides exclude. Cargo.toml itself is always included; sub-packages and the root target/ directory are always excluded. [1][2]\n\nUseful notes:\n- Use \"src/**\" or \"/src\" (or \"/src/**\") in include to ensure the src directory is packaged. [1]  \n- include must be exhaustive or necessary files will be missing. [1]  \n- include takes precedence over exclude. [1][2]\n\nSources: Cargo manifest docs. [1] Dev-doc/Cargo reference — Manifest Format; [2] Cargo change to gitignore-like patterns (explain \"/src\" behavior).\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**The `include` field will exclude source files from the published crate.**\n\nThe `include` field in Cargo.toml is exclusive—only the listed paths are packaged. With `include = [\"proto\"]`, the `src/` directory will be excluded from the crate, breaking it when published to crates.io.\n\nFix by including all necessary files:\n\n<details>\n<summary>🐛 Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n build = \"build.rs\"\n-include = [\"proto\"]\n+include = [\"src/**/*\", \"proto/**/*\"]\n```\n\n</details>\n\n(Note: `Cargo.toml` and `build.rs` are automatically included by Cargo.)\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@libs/system-sdks/directory-grpc/Cargo.toml` around lines 8 - 12, The\nCargo.toml's include field is currently set to only \"proto\", which will exclude\nthe src/ code when the crate is published; update Cargo.toml to remove or\nbroaden the include entry so that src/** (and other needed files like Cargo.toml\nand build.rs which Cargo already includes) are packaged—specifically edit the\ninclude key referenced in the diff (the line `include = [\"proto\"]`) to either\nremove it entirely or change it to include \"src/**\" (and any other necessary\nfiles) so the library named by [lib] name = \"cf_system_directory_grpc\" is not\nexcluded from the published crate.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:ocelot -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-01-21T15:32:41Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T15:32:42Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/284#discussion_r2713112365","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/284","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2713112365"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/284#discussion_r2713112365"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/284"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2713112365/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":8,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":null,"original_line":12,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":14,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2713112371","pull_request_review_id":3687885583,"id":2713112371,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6hts8z","diff_hunk":"@@ -26,9 +26,9 @@ pub struct ModuleOrchestratorConfig;\n /// - Exposes `DirectoryService` gRPC service via `grpc_hub`\n /// - Tracks module instances and provides service resolution\n #[modkit::module(\n-    name = \"module_orchestrator\",\n+    name = \"directory\",\n     capabilities = [grpc, system],\n-    client = module_orchestrator_sdk::DirectoryClient\n+    client = cf_system_sdks::directory::DirectoryClient\n )]","path":"modules/system/module_orchestrator/src/module.rs","com