\"\necho \"=== Searching for module_orchestrator references more broadly ===\"\nrg -n 'module_orchestrator' --type rust -A 2 -B 2 | head -50 || echo \"No references found\"\n```\n\nRepository: hypernetix/hyperspot\n\nLength of output: 2119\n\n---\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\n# Check the actual configuration at the specified lines\necho \"=== config/quickstart.yaml around line 114 ===\"\nsed -n '110,120p' config/quickstart.yaml\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== config/quickstart-windows.yaml around line 114 ===\"\nsed -n '110,120p' config/quickstart-windows.yaml\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Search for 'directory' in config files to see if it's been updated ===\"\nrg -n '\"?directory\"?' config/quickstart.yaml config/quickstart-windows.yaml || echo \"No 'directory' references found\"\n```\n\nRepository: hypernetix/hyperspot\n\nLength of output: 1063\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**Update configuration files to use module name `directory` instead of `module_orchestrator`.**\n\nThe module name was changed to `\"directory\"` in the macro definition, but `config/quickstart.yaml` (line 114) and `config/quickstart-windows.yaml` (line 114) still reference `module_orchestrator` as the configuration key. This will cause runtime module lookup failures. Update both configuration files to use:\n```yaml\ndirectory:\n  config: {}\n```\ninstead of the current `module_orchestrator:` key.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn `@modules/system/module_orchestrator/src/module.rs` around lines 28 - 32, The\nmodule macro now declares name = \"directory\" (see modkit::module entry), but the\nquickstart configuration files still use the old top-level key\n\"module_orchestrator\"; update the quickstart YAML configs to replace the\nmodule_orchestrator: key with directory: and set its value to config: {} so the\nruntime lookup matches the modkit::module name=\"directory\" declaration. Ensure\nboth quickstart YAML variants use the exact key \"directory\" (not\nmodule_orchestrator) and include the config: {} block.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:ocelot -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->","created_at":"2026-01-21T15:32:41Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T15:32:42Z","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/284#discussion_r2713112371","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/284","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2713112371"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/284#discussion_r2713112371"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/284"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2713112371/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":28,"original_start_line":28,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":32,"original_line":32,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":18,"position":15,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments/2713447912","pull_request_review_id":3688302552,"id":2713447912,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPaLyBs6hu-3o","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@\n+[package]\n+name = \"cf-system-sdks\"\n+version = \"0.1.0\"\n+edition.workspace = true\n+license.workspace = true\n+authors.workspace = true\n+repository.workspace = true\n+description = \"Collection of system modules SDKs\"\n+rust-version.workspace = true","path":"libs/system-sdks/Cargo.toml","commit_id":"69748c6cb4794a442e7817368386788dadac45cb","original_commit_id":"167a25457cab576cf505167a1c4dd396da29be9b","user":{"login":"coderabbitai[bot]","id":136622811,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCCSy2w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/347564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coderabbitai%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.