y><blockquote>\n\n`15-15`: **Same publishability check for workspace deps.**\n\nPlease apply the same verification as noted earlier to ensure the `modkit*` workspace entries are versioned for publishing.\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>examples/plugin-modules/tenant_resolver/tenant_resolver-gw/Cargo.toml (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`18-20`: **Same publishability check for workspace deps.**\n\nPlease apply the same verification as noted earlier to ensure the `modkit*` workspace entries are versioned for publishing.\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>examples/oop-modules/calculator_gateway/calculator_gateway/Cargo.toml (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`14-15`: **Same publishability check for workspace deps.**\n\nPlease apply the same verification as noted earlier to ensure the `modkit*` workspace entries are versioned for publishing.\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>examples/oop-modules/calculator/calculator/Cargo.toml (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`24-26`: **Same publishability check for workspace deps.**\n\nPlease apply the same verification as noted earlier to ensure the `modkit*` workspace entries are versioned for publishing.\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧹 Nitpick comments (6)</summary><blockquote>\n\n<details>\n<summary>libs/modkit-security/Cargo.toml (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`1-10`: **Missing `description` field for crates.io publishing.**\n\nFor crates.io publishing, the `description` field is required metadata. Other crates in this PR (e.g., `simple-user-settings-sdk`) include explicit descriptions. Consider adding `description.workspace = true` or an explicit description.\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested addition</summary>\n\n```diff\n [package]\n name = \"cf-modkit-security\"\n version = \"0.1.0\"\n edition.workspace = true\n license.workspace = true\n authors.workspace = true\n repository.workspace = true\n+description.workspace = true\n```\n</details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>libs/modkit/Cargo.toml (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`1-13`: **Missing `description` field for crates.io publishing.**\n\nSimilar to `modkit-security`, this crate is missing the `description` field which is required for crates.io. Consider adding `description.workspace = true` for consistency with other libs (e.g., `modkit-utils`).\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested addition</summary>\n\n```diff\n [package]\n name = \"cf-modkit\"\n version = \"0.1.0\"\n edition.workspace = true\n license.workspace = true\n authors.workspace = true\n repository.workspace = true\n+description.workspace = true\n```\n</details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>examples/oop-modules/calculator_gateway/calculator_gateway-sdk/Cargo.toml (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`1-25`: **Consider adding the `[lints]` section for consistency.**\n\nOther SDK crates in this PR include `[lints]\\nworkspace = true` for consistent lint configuration across the workspace. This file is missing that section.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested addition</summary>\n\n```diff\n [package]\n name = \"calculator_gateway-sdk\"\n version = \"0.1.0\"\n edition.workspace = true\n license.workspace = true\n authors.workspace = true\n description = \"SDK for calculator_gateway module: API trait, types, and client wiring\"\n\n+[lints]\n+workspace = true\n+\n [dependencies]\n```\n</details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>examples/plugin-modules/tenant_resolver/tenant_resolver-sdk/Cargo.toml (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`1-7`: **Consider adding `publish = false` for example crates.**\n\nSince this is an example SDK not intended for crates.io publishing, consider adding `publish = false` to prevent accidental publishing and clarify intent.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested change</summary>\n\n```diff\n [package]\n name = \"tenant-resolver-sdk\"\n version.workspace = true\n+publish = false\n edition.workspace = true\n license.workspace = true\n authors.workspace = true\n```\n</details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>modules/system/module_orchestrator/module_orchestrator-grpc/Cargo.toml (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`26-27`: **Consider adding workspace lint inheritance.**\n\nOther crates in this PR include `[lints]\\nworkspace = true` for consistent lint configuration. This file only has the specific `[lints.rust]` section for `unexpected_cfgs`. You can inherit workspace lints while keeping the specific config:\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested addition</summary>\n\n```diff\n+[lints]\n+workspace = true\n+\n [lints.rust]\n unexpected_cfgs = { level = \"warn\", check-cfg = ['cfg(coverage_nightly)'] }\n```\n</details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>modules/system/api_gateway/Cargo.toml (1)</summary><blockquote>\n\n`47-52`: **Potential publish blocker: path dev-dependency.**\n\nIf `api_gateway` is intended for crates.io, the path dev-dep `hs-tenant-resolver-sdk` (Line 51) will prevent `cargo publish`. Consider switching it to a workspace/versioned dependency or mark this crate `publish = false` if it’s internal-only.\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>🔧 If it’s a workspace member</summary>\n\n```diff\n-hs-tenant-resolver-sdk = { path = \"../tenant_resolver/tenant_resolver-sdk\" }\n+hs-tenant-resolver-sdk = { workspace = true }\n```\n</details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n</blockquote></details>\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit for review status -->","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/284#pullrequestreview-3683542868","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/284","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/284#pullrequestreview-3683542868"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/284"}},"submitted_at":"2026-01-20T17:55:09Z","commit_id":"581784a2f75425f25bd4af268954e231e5659745"},{"id":