 <br> `Cargo.toml` | Workspace resolver bumped 2→3; 12+ new workspace dependencies declared for modkit crates with multi-line feature arrays; existing dependency features reformatted (tracing-subscriber, opentelemetry-otlp, tower-http, utoipa, sqlx, sea-orm, reqwest, syn) |\n| **Workspace libraries - package metadata and lib sections** <br> `libs/modkit-*/Cargo.toml` (modkit-auth, modkit-db, modkit-db-macros, modkit-errors, modkit-errors-macro, modkit-macros, modkit-node-info, modkit-odata, modkit-odata-macros, modkit-sdk, modkit-security, modkit-transport-grpc, modkit-utils, modkit) | Package names prefixed with `cf-` (cf-modkit-auth, cf-modkit-db, etc.); explicit versions set to 0.1.0; authors and repository fields added; [lib] sections introduced with explicit library names (modkit\\_auth, modkit\\_db\\_macros, etc.); modkit-sdk adds dev-dependencies; modkit and modkit-odata add/expand dependencies |\n| **Workspace libraries - dependency resolution** <br> `libs/modkit/Cargo.toml`, `libs/modkit-auth/Cargo.toml`, `libs/modkit-odata/Cargo.toml`, `libs/modkit-sdk/Cargo.toml` | Path-based local dependencies replaced with workspace = true; modkit-errors/modkit-errors-macro (in modkit-odata); modkit-security (in modkit-auth, modkit-sdk); feature flag multi-line reformatting |\n| **App dependencies** <br> `apps/hyperspot-server/Cargo.toml` | modkit and modkit-db changed from path-based to workspace = true; feature flag reformatted to multi-line |\n| **Examples - users_info** <br> `examples/modkit/users_info/user_info-sdk/Cargo.toml`, `examples/modkit/users_info/users_info/Cargo.toml` | Path dependencies (modkit-odata-macros, modkit-security, modkit-sdk, modkit-odata, modkit-db, modkit-auth, etc.) replaced with workspace = true; sea-orm features extended with \"with-uuid\" |\n| **Examples - OOP modules calculator** <br> `examples/oop-modules/calculator/calculator-sdk/Cargo.toml`, `examples/oop-modules/calculator/calculator/Cargo.toml` | modkit, modkit-security, modkit-transport-grpc changed from path-based to workspace = true |\n| **Examples - OOP modules calculator gateway** <br> `examples/oop-modules/calculator_gateway/calculator_gateway-sdk/Cargo.toml`, `examples/oop-modules/calculator_gateway/calculator_gateway/Cargo.toml` | modkit and modkit-security path dependencies replaced with workspace = true |\n| **Examples - plugin modules tenant resolver** <br> `examples/plugin-modules/tenant_resolver/plugins/contoso_tr_plugin/Cargo.toml`, `examples/plugin-modules/tenant_resolver/plugins/fabrikam_tr_plugin/Cargo.toml`, `examples/plugin-modules/tenant_resolver/tenant_resolver-gw/Cargo.toml`, `examples/plugin-modules/tenant_resolver/tenant_resolver-sdk/Cargo.toml` | modkit, modkit-security, modkit-odata converted to workspace = true; new workspace dependencies added (tracing, serde with derive, schemars, arc-swap, inventory, serde_json) |\n| **Modules - simple-user-settings and file parser** <br> `modules/file_parser/Cargo.toml`, `modules/simple-user-settings/simple-user-settings-sdk/Cargo.toml`, `modules/simple-user-settings/simple-user-settings/Cargo.toml` | modkit, modkit-auth, modkit-db, modkit-security path dependencies replaced with workspace = true; sea-orm features array reformatted to multi-line |\n| **Modules - system components** <br> `modules/system/api_gateway/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/grpc_hub/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/module_orchestrator/module_orchestrator-grpc/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/module_orchestrator/module_orchestrator/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry-sdk/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/nodes_registry/nodes_registry/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/tenant_resolver/plugins/single_tenant_tr_plugin/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/tenant_resolver/plugins/static_tr_plugin/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/tenant_resolver/tenant_resolver-gw/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/tenant_resolver/tenant_resolver-sdk/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/types-registry/types-registry-sdk/Cargo.toml`, `modules/system/types-registry/types-registry/Cargo.toml` | Path-based modkit dependencies (modkit, modkit-transport-grpc, modkit-node-info, modkit-security, modkit-odata) replaced with workspace = true; new workspace dependencies added (async-trait, tokio utilities, tower, tracing) |\n| **Submodule** <br> `guidelines/DNA` | Submodule pointer updated to commit dde8f01 |\n\n## Estimated code review effort\n\n🎯 2 (Simple) | ⏱️ ~12 minutes\n\n## Possibly related PRs\n\n- **hypernetix/hyperspot#223**: Touches workspace member declarations and converts path dependencies to workspace = true in simple-user-settings and related crates.\n\n## Suggested reviewers\n\n- MikeFalcon77\n- Artifizer\n\n## Poem\n\n> 🐰 *Hops through manifests with glee,*  \n> *Workspace resolver bumped to three,*  \n> *Path deps → workspace = true,*  \n> *Cf-prefixed names anew!*  \n> *Dependencies consolidated, don't you see?* ✨\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary>🚥 Pre-merge checks | ✅ 3</summary>\n\n<details>\n<summary>✅ Passed checks (3 passed)</summary>\n\n|     Check name     | Status   | Explanation                                                                                                                                                                           |\n| :----------------: | :------- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n|  Description Check | ✅ Passed | Check skipped - CodeRabbit’s high-level summary is enabled.                                                                                                                           |\n|     Title check    | ✅ Passed | The title 'prepare naming for publishing' accurately summarizes the main change: renaming crates and workspace configuration to prepare for publishing libraries with a 'cf-' prefix. |\n| Docstring Coverage | ✅ Pa