_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/282.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/282","number":282,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"docs: add authorization design documentation with AuthZEN-based model","user":{"login":"aviator5","id":245955115,"node_id":"U_kgDODqj6Kw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245955115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5","html_url":"https://github.com/aviator5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Add 3 ADRs for PDP/PEP model, AuthN/AuthZ separation, and minimalist AuthN interface\r\n- Document gateway contracts for Tenant, Resource Group, AuthN, and AuthZ Resolvers\r\n- Define AuthZEN evaluation response extensions with constraint-based SQL filtering\r\n- Establish multi-tenancy terminology and access constraints model\r\n- Include JWT/OIDC plugin specification and authorization usage scenarios\r\n- Add Tenant and Resource Group model documentation\r\n\r\nCloses #228.\r\n\r\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\r\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\r\n\r\n* **Documentation**\r\n  * Added comprehensive authorization and authentication architecture documentation covering design patterns, architectural decisions, and implementation guidance.\r\n  * Added multi-tenant and resource group model documentation with schema patterns and usage examples.\r\n  * Added end-to-end authorization scenarios illustrating token handling and access control enforcement.\r\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->  *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   * ","created_at":"2026-01-20T16:33:20Z","updated_at":"2026-02-05T11:38:00Z","closed_at":"2026-02-05T11:25:33Z","merged_at":"2026-02-05T11:25:33Z","merge_commit_sha":"3e37508548e420a52137afe1fcc5592118c145e5","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/282/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/282/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/282/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/statuses/7b6c1372f62ef53f50207ca12e11c6accb4530c7","head":{"label":"aviator5:auth-resolver","ref":"auth-resolver","sha":"7b6c1372f62ef53f50207ca12e11c6accb4530c7","user":{"login":"aviator5","id":245955115,"node_id":"U_kgDODqj6Kw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245955115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5","html_url":"https://github.com/aviator5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/subscriptions","organ