wers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"GitHub Actions","description":"Automate your workflow from idea to production","external_url":"https://help.github.com/en/actions","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","created_at":"2018-07-30T09:30:17Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T14:51:38Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","administration":"read","artifact_metadata":"write","attestations":"write","checks":"write","code_quality":"write","contents":"write","copilot_requests":"write","deployments":"write","discussions":"write","issues":"write","merge_queues":"write","metadata":"read","models":"read","packages":"write","pages":"write","pull_requests":"write","repository_hooks":"write","repository_projects":"write","security_events":"write","statuses":"write","vulnerability_alerts":"read"},"events":["branch_protection_rule","check_run","check_suite","create","delete","deployment","deployment_status","discussion","discussion_comment","fork","gollum","issues","issue_comment","label","merge_group","milestone","page_build","public","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","push","registry_package","release","repository","repository_dispatch","status","watch","workflow_dispatch","workflow_run"]}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3836974093","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/282#issuecomment-3836974093","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/282","id":3836974093,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPaLyBs7ks5QN","user":{"login":"aviator5","id":245955115,"node_id":"U_kgDODqj6Kw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245955115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5","html_url":"https://github.com/aviator5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aviator5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T18:36:23Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T18:36:23Z","body":"> The document seems to be rather AuthZEN-based authorization design, not an ADR. If so, I'd expect it to be an AUTH_DESIGN.md doc with all the critical parts to be covered:\r\n> \r\n> 1. somehow mention the API tokens and explain what role they play (e.g. why can't we encode all the rules inside token)\r\n> 2. Since authorization is about API processing, explain the typical API hander flow - when we do what. For example, are we going to have 'fail fast' role check on the middleware level? If yes, would it also call AuthZEN\r\n> 3. Explain the ideas regarding how the auth rules will appear in the PDP service\r\n> \r\n> Also must be covered: 4. Caching strategy need to be explained somehow - otherwise the whole idea can be just not affordable 5. Empty filters semantics 6. I did not get if PDP knows about PEP DB schema or it has own column? If PDP knows about 'custom DB fields':\r\n> \r\n> * how such rules will be stored?\r\n> * How PDP would get 'custom DB fields schema update' (migrations)?\r\n> * How to make PDP and PEP schemas to be consistent (especially if they upgraded separately)\r\n\r\nCorrect, now the PR contains a series of ADRs + a set of design docs.\r\n1. Tokens and authentication flow is fully described in `AUTH.md` doc now.\r\n2. Authorization is not only about API processing, but yes, for performance-critical paths, API Gateway can reject requests early based on scope mismatch without calling PDP. In my view it should be an API Gateway's feature and should be described in its design. Not AuthN middleware because vendor may have coarse-grained scopes in token and map those scopes to fine-grained permissions on PDP layer.\r\n3. It depends on how the authZ is implemented on the vendor's side. For some vendors all auth rules are access policies that are stored in the Policy Manager, for another ones - just token's scopes. It's a plugin responsibility to implement  making authZ decision properly based on those authZ-related data. HyperSpot should be vendor-agnostic here.\r\n4. Caching itself is a huge are for research. Now I described authN-related caching, authZ-related decision caching is in TODO (among Open Questions list).\r\n5. Empty filters (constraints) semantic is covered in AUTH.md.\r\n6. PDP doesn't know the module's database schema. Domain module will use common library (modkit-db) for mapping authZ predicate resource properties to DB columns (see \"PEP Property Mapping\" in AUTH.md).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3836974093/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3839777677","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/pull/282#issuecomment-3839777677","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/282","id":3839777677,"node_id":"IC_kwDOPaLyBs7k3luN","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-03T08:17:05Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T08:17:05Z","body":"There are unresolved review comments awaiting response.\n\nUnanswered human review threads: 5\nUnresolved comments: 5","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberfabric/cyberware-rust/issues/comments/3839777677/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":15368,"client_id":"Iv1.05c79e9ad1f6bdfa","slug":"github-actions","node_id":"MDM6QXBwMTUzNjg=","owner":{"login":"github","id":9919,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjk5MTk=